><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ON\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movie.director_id = director.id;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><table name=\"Result\"><row><header content=\"movie\" /><header content=\"director\" /></row><row><data content=\"The Pianist\" /><data content=\"Polanski\" /></row><row><data content=\"Macbeth\" /><data content=\"Polanski\" /></row><row><data content=\"Somewhere\" /><data content=\"Coppola\" /></row></table></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>AS</code>, następnie <code>movie</code>, a potem <code>director.name</code>, <code>AS</code>, <code>director</code>.</p></body></html>"
